<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Coastal rated outperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Coastal rated outperform.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said analyst Dennis Higgins initiated coverage of Coastal Corp as outperform and Sonat Inc as neutral.</p>
<p>-- analyst not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Coastal rose 1-1/2 to 50, while Sonat was unchanged at 58.</p>
